==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|ampula|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|la|de}} {{term|ampulla|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʔampl̩/|/ˈʔampəl/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Ampel.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|g=f|plural=Ampeln}}

